			"notes": "Tacz:Labs 1.1.7更新\n\n\n - 优化了准星扩散值，现在扩散值受配件影响，同时开火扩散受后坐力影响\n\n - 为冲锋枪更新了括号准星\n\n - 为重武器更新了标尺准星\n\n - 中心点现在有两种样式，可以通过配置切换\n\n - 优化了英文翻译\n\n\n---\n\n\nTacz:Labs 1.1.7 Changelog\n\n\n - Optimized Crosshair Spread: The spread value is now dynamically influenced by attachments, and firing spread is accurately affected by weapon recoil.\n\n - New Bracket Crosshair: Added a specialized Bracket Crosshair style for Submachine Guns (SMGs).\n\n - New Ruler Crosshair: Added a Ruler (Stadia) Crosshair style designed for heavy weaponry.\n\n - Dual Center Dot Styles: The center dot now features two distinct styles, which can be toggled via the configuration file.\n\n - Translation Improvements: Optimized and refined English localizations."
		},
